From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:54:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor overlay performance: slope view rates 64x64 tiles once
 (sliding window maxima, block levels, dirty by height sink, time budget),
 draws at most 160 blocks per side with same-colour runs merged; node grids
 share projections by window, project lazily and only for cells that draw,
 skip empty cells and merge flat runs, ed_overlay_nodes_rect / ed_overlay_perf

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

